{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53717","headline":"送义存出家（题拟） 三 · 开成时儒","name":"送义存出家（题拟） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[原宪]（宪原）守贫志不移，颜回安命更谁知？\n嘉禾未必春前熟，君子从来用有时。\n（见《祖堂集》卷七）（按：《祖堂集》云：「师初出家，时儒假大德送三首诗。\n」师指义存，长庆二年生，十七出家，时在开成三年。\n「假大德」似非人名，「假」疑「贾」之误，未能臆定，故姑以「开成时儒」立目。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"开成时儒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}